---
// MultiSourcePainDiagram.astro
// Clean, focused visual diagram illustrating peripheral multi-source pain inputs into the trigeminal system.
// Strictly compliant with the 3 to 4 word title standard: No colons, no ampersands, no hyphens/dashes.
// Base image: /trigeminal-v2-v3-nerves-with-nucleus.jpg (with glowing red Subnucleus Caudalis in the brainstem).
// Left side: Physical sources on top (Red/Yellow), external/saliva/stress at bottom.
// Left badges: Solid rich gold/dark yellow (#eab308) with high-contrast black text (#0a0a0a).
// Right side: Neutral slate-gray specs for all trunk/nucleus axon capacities.
---

<div class="multi-source-pain-container tts-ignore" style="margin: 2.25rem 0 2.75rem; background: #070312; border: 1.5px solid #3b1d6e; border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.75rem; box-shadow: 0 16px 45px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); color: #f8fafc;">
  
  <!-- Header (Strict 3-4 Word Titles) -->
  <div style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #1e1338; padding-bottom: 1rem;">
    <div style="font-size: 0.76rem; font-weight: 800; color: #a855f7; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">
      Peripheral Drive
    </div>
    <div style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 900; color: #ffffff; line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0.45rem;">
      Multi-Source Pain Stacking
    </div>
    <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0; max-width: 820px; text-wrap: balance;">
      Left-aligned peripheral sources feed into the central trigeminal network, totaling 100% of sensory load. Physical hardware leaks sit up top, with systemic and external triggers below. Right-aligned specifications detail trunk carrying capacity in axon&nbsp;volume.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Medical Visual Viewport with Generous Dark Margins -->
  <div style="position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; background: #020005; border: 1px solid #281447; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; min-height: 580px; padding: 1.5rem 0;">
    
    <!-- Base Medical Render with Glowing Red Subnucleus Caudalis in Brainstem -->
    <img 
      src="/trigeminal-v2-v3-nerves-with-nucleus.jpg" 
      alt="3D medical render mapping trigeminal nerve trunks V2 V3, glowing red Subnucleus Caudalis hub in brainstem, and oral inputs" 
      style="width: 68%; max-width: 760px; height: auto; max-height: 600px; object-fit: contain; object-position: center; display: block; opacity: 0.90; filter: contrast(1.15) brightness(0.96);"
      loading="lazy"
    />

    <!-- SVG Clean Labels & Solid White Straight Connecting Lines Overlay (1200 x 640 viewBox) -->
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1200 640" style="position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none;" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      
      <!-- ============================================================ -->
      <!-- LEFT SIDE: SOURCES (PHYSICAL TOP, EXTERNAL/STRESS BOTTOM)    -->
      <!-- SOLID DARK YELLOW (#eab308) BADGES WITH BLACK TEXT (#000000) -->
      <!-- BADGES UNIFORMLY RIGHT-ALIGNED AT X=240..296                 -->
      <!-- ============================================================ -->

      <!-- 1. Leaky margin, 30% (TOP: Physical Crown Leak, Y=220) -->
      <g>
        <line x1="305" y1="220" x2="550" y2="310" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.8" opacity="0.9" />
        <circle cx="550" cy="310" r="4.5" fill="#ef4444" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.2" />

        <text x="50" y="225" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16" font-weight="800" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif" letter-spacing="0.01em">
          Leaky margin
        </text>
        <rect x="240" y="208" width="56" height="23" rx="4" fill="#eab308" stroke="#ca8a04" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="268" y="225" text-anchor="middle" fill="#000000" font-size="13" font-weight="900" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif">
          30%
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- 2. Canine occlusion, 20% (Physical Bite Overload, Y=280) -->
      <g>
        <line x1="305" y1="280" x2="520" y2="375" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.8" opacity="0.9" />
        <circle cx="520" cy="375" r="4.5" fill="#eab308" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.2" />

        <text x="50" y="285" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16" font-weight="800" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif" letter-spacing="0.01em">
          Canine occlusion
        </text>
        <rect x="240" y="268" width="56" height="23" rx="4" fill="#eab308" stroke="#ca8a04" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="268" y="285" text-anchor="middle" fill="#000000" font-size="13" font-weight="900" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif">
          20%
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- 3. Exposed tubules, 15% (Physical Root Surface, Y=340) -->
      <g>
        <line x1="305" y1="340" x2="495" y2="425" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.8" opacity="0.9" />
        <circle cx="495" cy="425" r="4.5" fill="#eab308" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.2" />

        <text x="50" y="345" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16" font-weight="800" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif" letter-spacing="0.01em">
          Exposed tubules
        </text>
        <rect x="240" y="328" width="56" height="23" rx="4" fill="#eab308" stroke="#ca8a04" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="268" y="345" text-anchor="middle" fill="#000000" font-size="13" font-weight="900" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif">
          15%
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- 4. External acid, 15% (External Chemical Ingress, Y=400) -->
      <g>
        <line x1="305" y1="400" x2="475" y2="475" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.8" opacity="0.9" />
        <circle cx="475" cy="475" r="4.5" fill="#eab308" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.2" />

        <text x="50" y="405" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16" font-weight="800" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif" letter-spacing="0.01em">
          External acid
        </text>
        <rect x="240" y="388" width="56" height="23" rx="4" fill="#eab308" stroke="#ca8a04" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="268" y="405" text-anchor="middle" fill="#000000" font-size="13" font-weight="900" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif">
          15%
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- 5. Lack of saliva, 15% (Oral Environment / Tongue, Y=460) -->
      <g>
        <line x1="305" y1="460" x2="455" y2="520" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.8" opacity="0.9" />
        <circle cx="455" cy="520" r="4.5" fill="#eab308" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.2" />

        <text x="50" y="465" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16" font-weight="800" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif" letter-spacing="0.01em">
          Lack of saliva
        </text>
        <rect x="240" y="448" width="56" height="23" rx="4" fill="#eab308" stroke="#ca8a04" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="268" y="465" text-anchor="middle" fill="#000000" font-size="13" font-weight="900" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif">
          15%
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- 6. Chronic stress, 5% (BOTTOM: Systemic Autonomic Tension, Y=520) -->
      <g>
        <line x1="305" y1="520" x2="575" y2="235" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.8" opacity="0.9" />
        <circle cx="575" cy="235" r="4.5" fill="#22c55e" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.2" />

        <text x="50" y="525" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16" font-weight="800" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif" letter-spacing="0.01em">
          Chronic stress
        </text>
        <rect x="240" y="508" width="56" height="23" rx="4" fill="#eab308" stroke="#ca8a04" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="268" y="525" text-anchor="middle" fill="#000000" font-size="13" font-weight="900" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif">
          5%
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- ============================================================ -->
      <!-- RIGHT SIDE: ALL UNIFORM NEUTRAL SLATE-GRAY AXON BADGES       -->
      <!-- SUBNUCLEUS CAUDALIS + V2 + V3 + LINGUAL                      -->
      <!-- ============================================================ -->

      <!-- 1. V2 Maxillary Trunk (50,000 Axons, Y=260) -->
      <g>
        <line x1="605" y1="305" x2="895" y2="260" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.8" opacity="0.9" />
        <circle cx="605" cy="305" r="4.5" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.2" />

        <text x="915" y="255" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16" font-weight="800" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif" letter-spacing="0.01em">
          V2 Maxillary Trunk
        </text>
        <rect x="915" y="264" width="130" height="23" rx="4" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#475569" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <text x="980" y="281" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="12.5" font-weight="800" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif">
          50,000 Axons
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- 2. Subnucleus Caudalis (140,000 Axons, Y=340) -->
      <g>
        <line x1="708" y1="355" x2="895" y2="340" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.8" opacity="0.9" />
        <circle cx="708" cy="355" r="5" fill="#ef4444" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.2" />

        <text x="915" y="335" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16" font-weight="800" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif" letter-spacing="0.01em">
          Subnucleus Caudalis
        </text>
        <rect x="915" y="344" width="130" height="23" rx="4" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#475569" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <text x="980" y="361" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="12.5" font-weight="800" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif">
          140,000 Axons
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- 3. V3 Mandibular Trunk (70,000 Axons, Y=420) -->
      <g>
        <line x1="655" y1="410" x2="895" y2="420" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.8" opacity="0.9" />
        <circle cx="655" cy="410" r="5" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.2" />

        <text x="915" y="415" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16" font-weight="800" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif" letter-spacing="0.01em">
          V3 Mandibular Trunk
        </text>
        <rect x="915" y="424" width="130" height="23" rx="4" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#475569" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <text x="980" y="441" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="12.5" font-weight="800" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif">
          70,000 Axons
        </text>
      </g>

      <!-- 4. Lingual Nerve (25,000 Axons, Y=500) -->
      <g>
        <line x1="620" y1="495" x2="895" y2="500" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.8" opacity="0.9" />
        <circle cx="620" cy="495" r="4.5" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.2" />

        <text x="915" y="495" fill="#ffffff" font-size="16" font-weight="800" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif" letter-spacing="0.01em">
          Lingual Nerve
        </text>
        <rect x="915" y="504" width="130" height="23" rx="4" fill="#1e293b" stroke="#475569" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <text x="980" y="521" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e2e8f0" font-size="12.5" font-weight="800" font-family="system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif">
          25,000 Axons
        </text>
      </g>

    </svg>

  </div>

</div>
